---
// French mentions légales page (LEGAL-01): site publisher identity, hosting
// provider, and business status, per LCEN Article 1-1 (current text,
// effective 2024-05-23 — this article was renumbered by the SREN law from
// its long-standing pre-2024 citation; do not cite the old, abolished
// numbering here, 04-RESEARCH.md Pitfall 2).
//
// Content source: the legal copy stays in code (developer review before any
// change; the copy lives in buildLegalNoticeModel(), src/lib/page-models.ts)
// while ONE value, siteSettings.publisherAddress, is read from Sanity at
// build time. Empty (the default) means the non-professional regime: the
// Article 1-1, II anonymity wording is shown and no address is published.
// Filled means the professional-publisher notice with the address typed in
// Studio. The model returns exactly one of the two, never both.
//
// Identity disclosure (D-08, RESOLVED): LCEN Article 1-1, I requires a
// professional editorial site to disclose the publisher's real legal name,
// not just a trade/brand name — "Romane Lepont, exerçant sous le nom
// commercial « Atelier Jacqueline Suzanne »".
//
// Hosting (D-07): OVH is the actual, live production host (Phase 5/v1.7
// shipped 2026-08-13). OVH SAS details verified directly against OVH's own
// live mentions-légales page (ovhcloud.com/fr/terms-and-conditions/) during
// the original Phase 4 task — that page does not itself publish a phone
// number for OVH SAS, so none is asserted here (04-RESEARCH.md Assumption A2
// delta, recorded in 04-01-SUMMARY.md). Florian holds the actual OVH hosting
// account (see README.md "Author" / CLAUDE.md), so the host sentence names
// him as account holder only. The repository is public, so his personal
// address is deliberately NOT in the repo (quick task 261004-kbq purged the
// earlier address). No phone number is published for either party.
//
// Open legal points: these texts have had no legal review; the Statut section
// still says non-professional even when the address is filled and must be
// revisited when the v1.x Shop/Checkout milestone ships (new CGV pages
// included); whether the host's phone number must appear is unverified.
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import {getSiteSettings} from '../lib/sanity';
import {buildLegalNoticeModel} from '../lib/page-models';

const model = buildLegalNoticeModel({siteSettings: await getSiteSettings(), locale: 'fr'});
const notice = model.publisherNotice;
---

<BaseLayout title="Mentions légales — Atelier Jacqueline Suzanne">
  <div class="legal-page">
    <h1>Mentions légales</h1>

    <h2>Éditeur du site</h2>
    <p>Romane Lepont, exerçant sous le nom commercial « Atelier Jacqueline Suzanne », à titre non professionnel.</p>
    <p>Directeur de la publication : Romane Lepont.</p>
    <p>E-mail : contact@atelierjacquelinesuzanne.fr</p>
    {
      notice.kind === 'address' ? (
        <p>
          {notice.lead}{' '}
          {notice.lines.map((line, index) => (
            <>
              {index > 0 && <br />}
              {line}
            </>
          ))}
        </p>
      ) : (
        <p>{notice.text}</p>
      )
    }
    <p>{model.hostedByNote}</p>

    <h2>Hébergement</h2>
    <p>
      OVH SAS — RCS Lille Métropole 424 761 419 00045 — Code APE 2620Z. Siège social : 2 rue
      Kellermann, 59100 Roubaix, France.
    </p>

    <h2>Statut</h2>
    <p>
      Statut : activité individuelle à titre non professionnel — activité occasionnelle en
      dessous du seuil imposant l'immatriculation.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-2xl) var(--space-md);
  }

  .legal-page h1 {
    font-size: var(--text-display-size); /* Display role */
    font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-xl);
  }

  .legal-page h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-heading-size); /* Heading role */
    font-weight: var(--weight-semibold);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: var(--space-2xl) 0 var(--space-md);
  }

  .legal-page p {
    font-size: var(--text-body-size); /* Body role */
    font-weight: var(--weight-regular);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-md);
  }

  .legal-page .placeholder {
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
